# NGINX Kubernetes Demo ☸️

A lightweight demo showing how to containerize a static web app, deploy it with a k8s cluster and expose externally using NGINX ingress Controller. This project is ideal for learning and demonstrating some of the fundamentals. 

---

## Build & Push 🧱 

- `docker build -t docker build -t _dockerusername_/nginx-demo:latest ./app`

- `docker push _dockerusername_/nginx-demo:latest`

  
  *Make sure you are logged in*: `docker login`

## Create the namespace 📦
- `kubectl apply -f k8s/namespace.yaml`   

## Deploy all resources 🚀

- `kubectl apply -f ./k8s`

    Deployment  
    Service  
    Ingress  
    Others

 ## Verify 🔥

- `kubectl get pods -n nginx-demo`
- `kubectl get ingress -n nginx-demo`

